OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after fatal police
OL,4,Apursuit crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man has been charged in
OL,7,Fconnection with the death of a
OL,8,Fpedestrian who was hit by a car during
OL,9,Fa police pursuit in Leeds.
OL,11,FThe 36-year-old woman died in hospital
OL,12,Fafter being struck by a black Vauxhall
OL,13,FCorsa in Beckett Street at about 09:52
OL,14,FGMT on Thursday, just minutes after it
OL,15,Ffailed to stop for officers on
OL,16,FHarehills Road.
OL,18,FHarry Gyamsie-Perah, of Coldcotes
OL,19,FGarth, Leeds, has been charged with
OL,20,Fcausing death by dangerous driving, and
OL,21,Fis due to appear at Leeds Crown Court
OL,22,Fon 27 November.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
